{"title":"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a2e8efcec5d1d64d51298ece5f84b729f7f4d23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)=x^3+ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c1854203936c3547922585c6064081ba8557419a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a1019e9826073b642e8f170160a49471bdc54add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> are roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabb43fc17c84547445784ce603feef770c999ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)=x^3+ax+b+240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"19\" />. Find the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/9224c384e6324a07e6f1fb851528d00fc475a260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> in both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is 0, the remaining root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/4/1a4cabbc6255a190bb6fb29dd338b8b8e4a30f4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(r+s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, and the remaining root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edbb8e4e2047dbb7dbd40b0c5cdfb019e48180e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(r+s+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />. The coefficients of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> are both equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and equating the two coefficients gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/9/569c7cbf64024e9fde3250a80bdac7db60b1f969.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rs-(r+s)^2 = (r+4)(s-3)-(r+s+1)^2\\]\" width=\"345\" height=\"20\" />from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/c/1fc8d0402dcfb10724b0741d9b011af7c1c58907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\tfrac 12 (5r+13)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\" />. Substitution should give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5af279366ac4e3109688b843997b056c8ceaaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -5$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/d/0bde359170829f653d087534939847c27a92cd2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f111742953959220887a8657330a1e69f80562e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = -6$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c569d583336516cd11ef4331cedf28aba2d3ca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 9$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32e53e6dcfef652671854d8eea970f5ee802450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|b| = 330, 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, for an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c779147f6883657b03f496677dc180ae263d37a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/76382d37161a94c1a8e38691ca897c9c72c91c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-r-s$\" width=\"53\" height=\"8\" /> be the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> (per Vieta's). Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/0870af71825e8d781973f110edbf3eccab8aac2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3 + ar + b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" /> and similarly for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Also,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b519125521b0a1ac6c2dd3381dab2e2c664b6b7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[q(r+4) = (r+4)^3 + a(r+4) + b  + 240 = 12r^2 + 48r + 304 + 4a = 0\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Set up a similar equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d8ede3c0cf58050757bb900e13139da55c52043.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[q(s-3) = (s-3)^3 + a(s-3) + b + 240 = -9s^2 + 27s + 213 - 3a = 0.\\]\" width=\"480\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying and adding the equations gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e0e3e6df7455b716454f1dccd2a9c55a5b76e30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align}\\tag{*} r^2 - s^2 + 4r + 3s + 49 &amp;= 0 \\end{align}\" width=\"342\" height=\"19\" />\nNow, let's deal with the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16ac88dd5af044d10a9c0e3fddbbe05f95c9a91d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> terms. Plugging the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/76382d37161a94c1a8e38691ca897c9c72c91c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-r-s$\" width=\"53\" height=\"8\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> yields a long polynomial, and plugging the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c1854203936c3547922585c6064081ba8557419a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a1019e9826073b642e8f170160a49471bdc54add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/f/6affb3cd131868fb024c22058ac3ed714c884eff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1-r-s$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> yields another long polynomial. Equating the coefficients of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in both polynomials, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa1d06b275da81b54ac926c27f499bcc8a8bb908.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rs + (-r-s)(r+s) = (r+4)(s-3) + (-r-s-1)(r+s+1),\\]\" width=\"503\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich eventually simplifies to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/e/1feee0bcb4227bb3e939bd670c43f597f3dcb9d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s = \\frac{13 + 5r}{2}.\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />\nSubstitution into (*) should give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5af279366ac4e3109688b843997b056c8ceaaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -5$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/d/0bde359170829f653d087534939847c27a92cd2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f111742953959220887a8657330a1e69f80562e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = -6$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c569d583336516cd11ef4331cedf28aba2d3ca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 9$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32e53e6dcfef652671854d8eea970f5ee802450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|b| = 330, 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, for an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c779147f6883657b03f496677dc180ae263d37a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/76382d37161a94c1a8e38691ca897c9c72c91c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-r-s$\" width=\"53\" height=\"8\" /> since they sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by Vieta's Formula (coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />). \n</p><p>Similarly, the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f503e81df10787253a3f1c45c897def1dc20de0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e2e91291f36a9026b238fdbf1421c109bdd79a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s - 3$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378bfcd9c88b76c99fe8b1b2dfdce7dc21b53f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-r-s-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />, as they too sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b240fd538c458b52d3a0cf6c9497310e6d8a81fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = rs+r(-r-s)+s(-r-s) = rs-(r+s)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"371\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/0317a7cce9a0ff3085584c9e07e4242f046afd95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b = rs(-r-s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa8f20941a904452dbfd159f821b094d40e74a11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=(r+4)(s-3)+(r+4)(-r-s-1)+(s-3)(-r-s-1) = (r+4)(s-3)-(r+s+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"741\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d487a711c76bcea891e513f31f10db21dcb401.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(b+240)=(r+4)(s-3)(-r-s-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"319\" height=\"20\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>From these equations, we can write that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/12715998d02a6900ba4e61b8a08cecc2ab3501c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rs-(r+s)^2 = (r+4)(s-3)-(r+s+1)^2 = a\\]\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\nand simplifying gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f56b8a48ee7f8e430d6f4ffb13759cb26202f178.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2s-5r-13=0 \\Rightarrow s = \\frac{5r+13}{2}.\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>We now move to the other two equations regarding the product of the roots. We see that we can cancel a negative from both sides to get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5c05be0fef30e023d8696ad4f8916c0dd7d5f60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rs(r+s) = b\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d39a0b3bf5deb1ba79d0ec2f3b17417738a62aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+4)(s-3)(r+s+1)=b + 240.\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"18\" /> Subtracting the first equation from the second equation gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77df742305b8e0dd8b39b304e0e93ff758231063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+4)(s-3)(r+s+1) - rs(r+s) = 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"337\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Expanding, simplifying, substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043c24280857192045395063f6a6179c2f9d9c3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\frac{5r+13}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" />, and simplifying some more yields the simple quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edfc45f449fdf486c16fe39296943c9f754547a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2 + 4r - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd38495e4e3850b2dd2ee90b622c309acc79373.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -5, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a144928077c6df4730b4157fdc84d17bf61f789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = -6, 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Finally, we substitute back into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776117828b8f1ae8a59524e8fb97e8ae8639c557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=rs(r+s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d31223b59719f7b931c2ed1c31879ff430874f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = (-5)(-6)(-5-6) = -330$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e4503da98975ee1770ab2de561e98a2494a101f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = (1)(9)(1 + 9) = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1e58ec651ead24d9ebe8ee3dbbed5a9af85ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-330|+|90| = \\boxed{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Vieta's, we know that the sum of roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore,\nthe roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c91764d1d1c579bd666c85c9d5bd15faf33ea6e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r, s, -r-s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"11\" />. By similar reasoning, the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />\nare <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62c914cbaba74ac66681f946d023603bf510c17c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + 4, s - 3, -r - s - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/06367c9dc7a96bcfb84ae5f16db43ba08b01c189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = (x - r)(x - s)(x + r + s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5e8a634e097de9ef8e22c712fa07c92096e942e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x) = (x - r - 4)(x - s + 3)(x + r + s + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"347\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> have the same coefficient for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we can go ahead\nand match those up to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1b17c7e4e54a8e20575235d8943a456f9908c5d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}     rs - r(r + s) - s(r + s) &amp;= (r + 4)(s - 3) - (r + 4)(r + s + 1) - (s - 3)(r + s + 1) \\\\     0 &amp;= -13 - 5r + 2s \\\\     s &amp;= \\frac{5r + 13}{2} \\end{align*}\" width=\"638\" height=\"87\" />\n</p><p>At this point, we can go ahead and compare the constant term in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b5f855b56cd269cd617940805cef31bc41a95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />. Doing so is certainly valid, but we can actually do this another way. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/c/62cbb3804e053a9c49ecce430073c684a386b657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(s) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/850e68ed1384f3c34a8e07bc0457448c0b52113a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(s) = 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. If we plug that into\nour expression, we get that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/6/cf6d9c8552f2cbe4ffabf50df985e1d23cdbb4b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}     q(s)  &amp;= 3(s - r - 4)(r + 2s + 1) \\\\     240 &amp;= 3(s - r - 4)(r + 2s + 1) \\\\     240 &amp;= 3\\left( \\frac{3r + 5}{2} \\right)(6r + 14) \\\\     80 &amp;= (3r + 5)(3r + 7) \\\\     0 &amp;= r^2 + 4r - 5 \\end{align*}\" width=\"241\" height=\"143\" />\nThis tells us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca8a3db80b61b06be0eb70678fade5092ccb3c9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r, s) = (1, 9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a4e778fc835622920c8ecd8f1bfababcebed4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5, -6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa30e2beb1820f6b39f6251023709c8165cefc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> is the product of the roots, we have that the two possibilities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d2767e2523f805ce67bd97ce12ff5c949b04b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 9 \\cdot (-10) = -90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/6/c2651c071c2dc3b2e786b144cccfd4c51bd2cbb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5)(-6)11 = 330$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />. Adding the absolute values of these gives us\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c779147f6883657b03f496677dc180ae263d37a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II\" title=\"2014 AIME II\">2014 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017025333\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 630/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 19443/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.437      1 -total\n 59.80%    8.036      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.50%    5.173      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12582:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017025333 and revision id 236685. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}